  "description": "Hui-Jun fled to a quiet rural area with the money he’d swindled from the con artists who’d scammed him.\n\nI’d heard this was a rural village with nothing but old people, but there’s a young guy here, and for some reason, whenever I’m around him, I keep doing things that make me look like a pervert?! Do you think I’m the only one who’ll end up looking like a pervert? Actually, I’m going to expose every single one of your perverted secrets, Seo Mun-Chan.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
